{
 "id": "seg6",
 "title": "放在模型外",
 "pill": 6,
 "total": 99.13,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg6-00",
   "text": "回到持有钱包的智能体。",
   "spoken": "回到持有钱包的智能体。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.64,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.4
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-01",
   "text": "防线不能放在模型里，模型理解指令的方式不可靠。",
   "spoken": "防线不能放在模型里，模型理解指令的方式不可靠。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.46,
   "dur": 4.632,
   "speechStart": 4.558,
   "speechEnd": 8.26
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-02",
   "text": "要在钱包这一层，用代码限制它。",
   "spoken": "要在钱包这一层，用代码限制它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-02.mp3",
   "start": 9.312,
   "dur": 3.504,
   "speechStart": 9.41,
   "speechEnd": 11.981
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-03",
   "text": "第一，额度，单笔和单日上限写在钱包工具或合约里，超额要人工确认。",
   "spoken": "第一，额度，单笔和单日上限写在钱包工具或合约里，超额要人工确认。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-03.mp3",
   "start": 13.036,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 13.134,
   "speechEnd": 18.931
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-04",
   "text": "第二，白名单，只允许向预设的地址和合约转账或授权。",
   "spoken": "第二，白名单，只允许向预设的地址和合约转账或授权。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.0,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 20.098,
   "speechEnd": 24.871
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-05",
   "text": "第三，权限隔离，智能体用独立的低额度钱包，主资产不交给它。",
   "spoken": "第三，权限隔离，智能体用独立的低额度钱包，主资产不交给它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.932,
   "dur": 6.552,
   "speechStart": 26.03,
   "speechEnd": 31.649
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-06",
   "text": "第四，人工确认，新地址、授权、大额操作走人工审批，界面显示解码后的交易。",
   "spoken": "第四，人工确认，新地址、授权、大额操作走人工审批，界面显示解码后的交易。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-06.mp3",
   "start": 32.704,
   "dur": 8.304,
   "speechStart": 32.802,
   "speechEnd": 40.159
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-07",
   "text": "第五，输入隔离，一个模型的输出，不能直接成为另一个智能体的指令。",
   "spoken": "第五，输入隔离，一个模型的输出，不能直接成为另一个智能体的指令。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-07.mp3",
   "start": 41.228,
   "dur": 6.072,
   "speechStart": 41.326,
   "speechEnd": 46.468
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-08",
   "text": "记忆写入要校验来源，转账前从链上读取余额，运维面板按特权系统加固。",
   "spoken": "记忆写入要较验来源，转账前从链上读取余额，运维面板按特权系统加固。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-08.mp3",
   "start": 47.52,
   "dur": 6.888,
   "speechStart": 47.618,
   "speechEnd": 53.57
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-09",
   "text": "给外部内容打上不可信标记，有用，但不够，模型仍可能照做。",
   "spoken": "给外部内容打上不可信标记，有用，但不够，模型仍可能照做。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-09.mp3",
   "start": 54.628,
   "dur": 6.408,
   "speechStart": 54.726,
   "speechEnd": 60.202
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-10",
   "text": "团队里，AI 写的代码和配置，和人写的一样，走审查、测试和审计。",
   "spoken": "团队里，AI 写的代码和配置，和人写的一样，走审查、测试和审计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-10.mp3",
   "start": 61.256,
   "dur": 6.84,
   "speechStart": 61.354,
   "speechEnd": 67.246
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-11",
   "text": "作为用户，不要把主钱包交给任何 AI 机器人，要用，就给它一个只放少量资金的独立钱包。",
   "spoken": "作为用户，不要把主钱包交给任何 AI 机器人，要用，就给它一个只放少量资金的独立钱包。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-11.mp3",
   "start": 68.316,
   "dur": 9.0,
   "speechStart": 68.414,
   "speechEnd": 76.473
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-12",
   "text": "回到开头的问题。",
   "spoken": "回到开头的问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-12.mp3",
   "start": 77.536,
   "dur": 2.16,
   "speechStart": 77.634,
   "speechEnd": 78.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-13",
   "text": "写在提示词里的规则，会被说服绕过。",
   "spoken": "写在提示词里的规则，会被说服绕过。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-13.mp3",
   "start": 79.916,
   "dur": 3.696,
   "speechStart": 80.014,
   "speechEnd": 82.787
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-14",
   "text": "写在合约里的规则不会，合约按代码拒绝这笔转账，模型说什么都没用。",
   "spoken": "写在合约里的规则不会，合约按代码拒绝这笔转账，模型说什么都没用。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-14.mp3",
   "start": 83.832,
   "dur": 6.144,
   "speechStart": 83.93,
   "speechEnd": 89.156
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-15",
   "text": "安全边界，要放在模型之外。",
   "spoken": "安全边界，要放在模型之外。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/handbook/video/skeuo/ep26/audio/lines/seg6-15.mp3",
   "start": 90.196,
   "dur": 3.192,
   "speechStart": 90.294,
   "speechEnd": 92.544
  },
  {
   "id": "seg6-16",
   "text": "下一集讲审计、测试与开发流程。",
   "spoken": "下一集讲审计、测试与开发流程。",
